<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Morgan Stanley said it has issued a total of one million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on registered shares of Novartis AG </p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20  warrants.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   15.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	23.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  2,270 CHF</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	STRIKE	ISSUE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	 2,300 CHF   14.70 CHF  14.27 PCT    7.2 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	 2,500 CHF   10.75 CHF  19.60 PCT   10.56 TIMES</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
